{"id":"word:hebrew:H8605","type":"word","title":"תְּפִלָּה","subtitle":"H8605 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"intercession , supplication ; by implication, a hymn","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to תְּפִלָּה (H8605) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-f.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 77 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"תְּפִלָּה (tᵉphillâh) means intercession , supplication ; by implication, a hymn First listed occurrence: 1Kgs 8 28."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"תְּפִלָּה","transliteration":"tᵉphillâh","pronunciation":"tef-il-law'","strong":"H8605","lemmaId":"hebrew:H8605","partOfSpeech":"n-f","forms":["הַ/תְּפִלָּ֔ה","תְּפִלָּתִֽ/י","תְּפִלָּתִ֑/י","תְּפִלָּתָ֖/ם","תְּפִלָּתֶ֔/ךָ"],"morphs":[["HNcfsc/Sp1cs",20],["HNcfsa",17],["HNcfsc",7],["HTd/Ncfsa",6],["HNcfsc/Sp3mp",6],["HNcfsc/Sp2ms",4],["HR/Ncfsc",3],["HC/Ncfsc/Sp3ms",3],["HC/Ncfsc/Sp1cs",3],["HRd/Ncfsa",2]]},"definitions":{"short":"intercession , supplication ; by implication, a hymn","usage":"prayer.","full":"H8605. tephillah תְּפִלָּה 77 noun feminine prayer ; — ׳ת Isa 1:15 +, construct תְּמִּלַּת Psa 80:5 +; suffix תְּפלָּתִי 4:2 +, etc.; plural תְּפִלּוֺת 72:20 ; &#8212; 1. a. prayer , 1Kin 8:38 2Chr 6:29 ; Isa 1:15 ; Psa 35:13 ; 80:5 +. b. pray a prayer , ׳הִתְפ ׳ת 2Sam 7:27 ; 1Kin 8:54 (compare 8:28 ; 8:29 2Chr 6:19-20 ,); בַּתּ ׳דִּבֶּר Dan 9:21 ; specifically of intercession, ת ׳נשׂא , with בְּעַד in behalf of 2Kin 19:4 = Isa 37:4 ; Jer 7:16 ; 11:14 . c. ׳ת אֶלאֱֿלֹהִים 2Chr 33:18 , לְאֵל Psa 42:9 , compare 69:14 ; with verb + לפני 88:3 ; 141:2 ; ׳תּ תְּקַדְּמֶ֑ךָּ 88:14 . d. ת ׳בית Isa 56:7 (twice in verse) house of prayer (temple); with verb + ׳אֶליֿ + אלהֿיכל Jonah 2:8 ; with verb + קדשׁו למעון 2Chr 30:27 . e. hear prayer ת (אֶתֿ) ׳שׁמע 1Kin 8:45 , 49 2Chr 6:35 , 39 ; 1Kin 9:3 ; Psa 4:2 ; 39:13 9 t.; אֶלתֿ ׳שׁמע 1Kin 8:28-29 , 2Chr 6:19-20 , Neh 1:6 ; Dan 9:17 ; ת ׳פנהאל 1Kin 8:28 2Chr 6:19 ; Psa 102:18 ; לת קַשֻּׁבוֺת ׳אָזְנֶיךָ 2Chr 6:40 ; 7:15 , compare Neh 1:11 ( אֶל ), ׳ת הַקְשִׁיבָה Psa 61:2 ; ת בְּקוֺל ׳הִקְשִׁיבּ 66:19 ; ת ׳הַאֲזִינָה 17:1 ; 55:2 ; 86:6 ; ת ׳לקח 6:10 ; compare 66:20 ; 102:18 b. 2 in Psalm-titles, poetic, liturgical prayer Psa 17:1 ; 86:1 ; 90:1 ; 102:1 ; 142:1 ; Hab 3:1 ; of Davidic Psalter, דוד תפלות Psa 72:20 .","rootNote":"from 6419 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Kgs 8 28","keyReferences":["1Kgs 8 28","1Kgs 8 28","1Kgs 8 29","1Kgs 8 38","1Kgs 8 45","1Kgs 8 49","1Kgs 8 54","1Kgs 9 3"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":77,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Kgs 8 28","book":"1Kgs","chapter":8,"verse":28,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"תְּפִלַּ֧ת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc"},{"reference":"1Kgs 8 28","book":"1Kgs","chapter":8,"verse":28,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/תְּפִלָּ֔ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncfsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 8 29","book":"1Kgs","chapter":8,"verse":29,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/תְּפִלָּ֔ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncfsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 8 38","book":"1Kgs","chapter":8,"verse":38,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"תְּפִלָּ֣ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 8 45","book":"1Kgs","chapter":8,"verse":45,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"תְּפִלָּתָ֖/ם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc/Sp3mp"},{"reference":"1Kgs 8 49","book":"1Kgs","chapter":8,"verse":49,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"תְּפִלָּתָ֖/ם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc/Sp3mp"},{"reference":"1Kgs 8 54","book":"1Kgs","chapter":8,"verse":54,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/תְּפִלָּ֥ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncfsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 9 3","book":"1Kgs","chapter":9,"verse":3,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"תְּפִלָּתְ/ךָ֣","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc/Sp2ms"},{"reference":"2Chr 6 19","book":"2Chr","chapter":6,"verse":19,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"תְּפִלַּ֧ת",